        "note": "Extracted ONCE PER CROP, because unadapted DINOv2 at 130mm and at 150mm are different feature sets. They appear as before_cl/dinov2-unadapted@crop130mm and @crop150mm. Each is the floor for its own arm; they are NOT a common reference and the two arms' gains over them must not be differenced against each other.",
